  "protocolVersion": 1,
  "name": "A second snapshot merges entries instead of replacing them",
  "description": "The watch logs an entry the phone has not seen. A snapshot the phone then sends carries structure, position, revision, and timers — and its own entry list, which does not include the watch's. The watch's entry must survive: entries merge by entryId, while structure, position, and timers are replaced. The snapshot also carries no hold timer, which clears the one an incremental message had started.",
